\paragraph{Aspect 12: assignments are not re-evaluated.}
The critical aspect is statefulness: an assignment happens at its
line, using the values current at that moment.
The lazy distractor encodes the belief that the variable holds the
calculation and re-evaluates it when printed
\autocite{Kohn2017VariableEvaluation}.

